[[!meta robots="noindex"]]

Translators coordinate on the tails-l10n mailing
list (<i>l10n</i> stands for [[!wikipedia Software_localization desc="localization"]]).

This is where important changes to translatable strings are announced.
So, please <a href="https://lists.torproject.org/mailman3/postorius/lists/tails-l10n.lists.torproject.org/">subscribe</a> to the list if you want to become a regular
translator.

Public archive of tails-l10n: <a
href="https://lists.torproject.org/mailman3/hyperkitty/list/tails-l10n@lists.torproject.org/">https://lists.torproject.org/mailman3/hyperkitty/list/tails-l10n@lists.torproject.org/</a>.
